        <h2><span class="entryprev"><a href="https://thebaseballchronicle.com/personal_stories/50_years_a_cubs_fan_part_one" title="Previous story">&#8592;</a></span> <a href="https://thebaseballchronicle.com/personal_stories/">Personal stories</a>, August 2009 <span class="entrynext"><a href="https://thebaseballchronicle.com/personal_stories/50_years_a_cubs_fan_part_three" title="Next story">&#8594;</a></span</h2>
